SUMMARY:🍽 Pork Chops + Roasted Potatoes
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 45 min\n\nSeason chops with garlic butter seasoning. Roast potatoes and bell peppers together on a sheet pan.\n\nIngredients:\n• 1 pkg – Pork Ribeye Chops Boneless\n• 0.5 bag – Fresh Whole Russet Potatoes\, 5 lb bag\n• 1 bag – Fresh Whole Color Bell Peppers\, 3 Count Bag\n• 0.5 each – Fresh Red Onion\n• 0.5 jar – bettergoods Garlic Butter Flavored Seasoning\, 3 oz
END:VEVENT
