SUMMARY:🍽 Taco Tuesday
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 30 min\n\nSet up a taco bar — kids love building their own.\n\nIngredients:\n• 1.5 lb – 73% Lean / 27% Fat Ground Beef\, 1 lb\n• 1 pkg – Old El Paso Stand 'N Stuff Taco Shells OR Flour Tortillas\n• 1 pkt – Great Value Mild Chili Seasoning Mix (as taco seasoning)\, 1 oz\n• 1 can – Old El Paso Traditional Canned Refried Beans\, 16 oz\n• 1 bag – Great Value Fiesta Blend Shredded Cheese\, 8 oz\n• 0.5 tub – Great Value Light Sour Cream\, 16 oz\n• 1 each – Fresh Green Bell Pepper\n• 0.5 each – Fresh Red Onion OR Sweet Onion\n• 2 each – Fresh Lime\n• 1 head – Romaine or Iceberg Lettuce\n• 2 each – Fresh Roma Tomatoes\n• 1 can – Ro-Tel Diced Tomatoes & Green Chilies
