SUMMARY:🍽 Ravioli Night
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 20 min\n\nbettergoods ravioli + jarred sauce + garlic bread. Rotate flavors: Butternut Squash\, Ricotta & Lemon\, Sweet Corn & Burrata.\n\nIngredients:\n• 2 pkg – bettergoods Ravioli (Butternut Squash OR Ricotta & Lemon OR Sweet Corn & Burrata)\, 18 oz\n• 1 jar – Bertolli Alfredo OR Prego Tomato Sauce\, 24 oz\n• 1 pkg – Freshness Guaranteed Garlic Bread\, 16 oz
