SUMMARY:🍽 Hot Dog Night
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 15 min\n\nSides: Kraft Deluxe mac and cheese / frozen broccoli\n\nHot dogs + Kraft Deluxe mac + frozen broccoli. Put pork chops in fridge to defrost tonight.\n\nKeep it easy — chips and a fruit cup on the side.\n\nIngredients:\n• 2 pkg – Oscar Mayer Classic Wieners\, 10 ct\n• 1 pkg – Ball Park White Hot Dog Buns\, 8 ct\n• 0.25 pkg – Kraft Singles American Cheese\n• 1 as needed – Ketchup & Mustard (pantry)
