SUMMARY:🍽 4th of July BBQ — Ribs + Elote + Baked Beans
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 180 min\n\nBuy now (freeze/shelf-stable): ribs\, cotija\, Valentina. Buy week of Jul 4: fresh corn\, watermelon\, beer\, Kool-Aid.\n\nBuy watermelon and drinks week of. Elote: cotija + mayo + lime + Valentina + roasted peppers.\n\nIngredients:\n• 2 rack – Pork Baby Back Ribs\n• 6 each – Fresh Sweet Corn on the Cob\n• 1 pkg – Cotija Cheese\n• 0.25 jar – Duke's Real Mayonnaise\n• 2 each – Fresh Limes\n• 1 bottle – Valentina Hot Sauce\n• 1 can – Bush's Maple and Cured Bacon Baked Beans
